# Exclude target *contents* (file-level), not the target directory itself
# — Docker legacy builder won't honor `!` negation underneath a parent
# directory that's been excluded as a dir. File-level exclusion + negation
# is the only combination that actually re-includes the api fat jar.
**/target/*
!agentcook-api/target/agentcook-api-*-SNAPSHOT.jar
!agentcook-api/target/agentcook-api-*.jar
**/.idea/
**/*.iml
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings/
**/.vscode/
**/.DS_Store
.git/
